{"id":"bcad0e308cb04405128cfc6eb1d7c15956b7571c","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"bcad0e308cb04405128cfc6eb1d7c15956b7571c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"changelogs/current/new_features/dynamic_modules__go_bootstrap.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@","+Added Go SDK support for bootstrap extension lifecycle hooks, asynchronous","+initialization, main-thread scheduling and shutdown completion."],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"changelogs/current/new_features/dynamic_modules__go_cluster.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@","+Added Go SDK bindings for cluster lifecycle, asynchronous initialization, main-thread scheduling","+and per-worker events. Register a cluster with ``sdk.RegisterClusterConfigFactories``. Go clusters","+cannot add hosts yet."],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/other_features/bootstrap_extensions/dynamic_modules.rst","lines":["@@ -34,6 +34,38 @@ Example Configuration","         \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/google.protobuf.StringValue","         value: \"my_config\""," ","+Go SDK","+------","+","+The Go SDK supports bootstrap configuration factories, lifecycle hooks, initialization targets,","+and main-thread scheduling. Register a ``shared.BootstrapExtensionConfigFactory`` with","+``sdk.RegisterBootstrapExtensionConfigFactories`` during Go package initialization. Its","+``Create`` method receives a ``shared.BootstrapExtensionConfigHandle`` and returns a","+``shared.BootstrapExtensionConfig``. The configuration's ``Create`` method constructs each","+extension instance. Embed ``shared.EmptyBootstrapExtensionConfig`` and","+``shared.EmptyBootstrapExtension`` to inherit the optional hooks for each.","+","+Call ``SignalInitComplete`` exactly once to release the bootstrap initialization target. For","+asynchronous initialization, obtain ``GetScheduler`` on the main thread, perform background work,","+then use ``Schedule`` to call ``SignalInitComplete`` back on the main thread. Scheduled tasks may","+schedule more tasks. The SDK discards pending tasks at configuration destruction and ignores","+later scheduling attempts. ``SignalInitComplete`` can run lifecycle hooks and wait for workers","+to start before it returns. Release any locks those hooks need before calling it.","+","+``OnShutdown`` receives a completion function. Call it after cleanup finishes; it can be retained","+for asynchronous cleanup and called from another goroutine. The SDK ignores repeated calls and","+completes shutdown if the hook panics. Otherwise Envoy waits for completion before exiting.","+Put essential cleanup in ``OnDestroy`` because Envoy skips ``OnShutdown`` during shutdown before","+workers start and in ``init_only`` and ``validate`` modes. Configuration and instance ``OnDestroy``","+callbacks have separate lifetimes. As with other Go dynamic modules, configure","+``do_not_close: true`` so the Go runtime remains loaded.","+","+Modules that need bootstrap APIs such as HTTP callouts or timers can supply their own","+bootstrap ABI hooks. Build with ``go build -buildmode=c-shared -tags envoy_dynamic_modules_go_custom_bootstrap``","+to omit the SDK's bootstrap exports. The module then supplies all required bootstrap hooks.","+Use ``envoy_dynamic_modules_go_custom_cluster`` for a hand-written cluster ABI. The tags are","+independent and can be combined. Other SDK extension kinds remain available.","+"," Lifecycle Hooks"," ---------------"," "],"additions":32,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/BUILD","lines":["@@ -107,6 +107,10 @@ envoy_cc_library("," go_library(","     name = \"go_sdk_shared\",","     srcs = [","+        \"sdk/go/shared/bootstrap.go\",","+        \"sdk/go/shared/bootstrap_api.go\",","+        \"sdk/go/shared/cluster.go\",","+        \"sdk/go/shared/cluster_api.go\",","         \"sdk/go/shared/common.go\",","         \"sdk/go/shared/early_header_mutation.go\",","         \"sdk/go/shared/early_header_mutation_api.go\",","@@ -166,11 +170,26 @@ go_test(","     embed = [\":go_sdk_internal_recovery\"],"," )"," ","+go_library(","+    name = \"go_sdk_internal_scheduler\",","+    srcs = [\"sdk/go/internal/scheduler/scheduler.go\"],","+    importpath = \"github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/source/extensions/dynamic_modules/sdk/go/internal/scheduler\",","+    visibility = [\"//test/extensions/dynamic_modules:__pkg__\"],","+)","+","+exports_files(","+    [\"sdk/go/internal/scheduler/scheduler_test.go\"],","+    visibility = [\"//test/extensions/dynamic_modules:__pkg__\"],","+)","+"," go_library(","     name = \"go_sdk_abi\",","     srcs = [","+        \"sdk/go/abi/bootstrap.go\",","+        \"sdk/go/abi/cluster.go\",","         \"sdk/go/abi/common.go\",","         \"sdk/go/abi/early_header_mutation.go\",","+        \"sdk/go/abi/handle.go\",","         \"sdk/go/abi/header_formatter.go\",","         \"sdk/go/abi/internal.go\",","         \"sdk/go/abi/listener.go\",","@@ -192,6 +211,7 @@ go_library(","         \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:go_sdk\",","         \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:go_sdk_internal_buffer\",","         \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:go_sdk_internal_recovery\",","+        \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:go_sdk_internal_scheduler\",","         \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:go_sdk_shared\",","     ],"," )"],"additions":20,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/sdk/go/abi/bootstrap.go","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@","+//go:build !envoy_dynamic_modules_go_custom_bootstrap","+","+package abi","+","+/*","+#include <stdint.h>","+#include \"../../../abi/abi.h\"","+","+static inline void bootstrap_complete(envoy_dynamic_module_type_event_cb callback, void* context) {","+  callback(context);","+}","+*/","+import \"C\"","+","+import (","+\t\"sync\"","+\t\"unsafe\"","+","+\tsdk \"github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/source/extensions/dynamic_modules/sdk/go\"","+\t\"github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/source/extensions/dynamic_m